{
  "_comment": [
    "The DECLARED field and row scope of every endpoint with a redaction or role-scope rule.",
    "tools/sairn_field_scope_check.py holds the real handler to it, per role, and refuses a",
    "push that breaks it. A declaration is the DESIGN, written from the write site and the",
    "decision that set it -- never read off the read branch, or the check agrees with the",
    "code by construction.",
    "",
    "tables: rows seeded into the mock. A null value becomes a unique MARKER string; any",
    "other value is literal and is not accounted. roles: every role the app has (from",
    "api/_lib/auth.js ROLES_BY_APP) must appear. see: 'tag.field' or 'tag.*' -- the markers",
    "that role MUST get back; every other marker must be ABSENT anywhere in the body. That is",
    "the diff of returned fields against the allowed set, closed-world and shape-independent.",
    "refused: true -- that role must get 401/403 and no marker at all. flags: top-level body",
    "values that role must see.",
    "",
    "ADDING A RULE (cc b63; owners per read since cc b69 in docs/2026-10-29-cc-b69-field-scope-routing.md):",
    "  1. Write it from the DESIGN (the write site, the decision that set the scope), never off the read branch.",
    "  2. Required keys: id, app, anchor (one exact line of api/sd-data.js), request {action, resource[, payload]},",
    "     declared_from, tables, roles. Optional: caller (default emp-self), sets, live.",
    "  3. tables: every table the branch reads, rows with a unique 'tag'. Columns the branch FILTERS on (eq.)",
    "     must be present, or the row is filtered out and the role reads as MISSING. Seed any lookup table too.",
    "  4. Typed columns (timestamptz, numeric) cannot hold FSMK...: use {\"marker\": \"2001-02-03T04:05:09.101\"}.",
    "  5. roles: EVERY role in ROLES_BY_APP[app]. Each is {see: [...]} or {refused: true}; optional flags {}.",
    "     A role scoped to its own rows sees only 'self.*'; put the caller's id ('emp-self') in the owner column.",
    "  6. Check it: python tools/sairn_field_scope_check.py --validate   then   python tools/sairn_field_scope_check.py",
    "  7. Mock limits: only <col>=eq.<v> and select= are honoured. in./neq./order/limit are IGNORED, which returns",
    "     MORE rows -- a false LEAK is loud, never a silent pass. Say so in declared_from if a filter matters.",
    "  8. live (optional): licence_env, auth_path, creds {role: [EMP_ENV, PIN_ENV]}, employees {emp-self: <real id>}.",
    "     Fixture rows must be seeded with THESE markers: generate the SQL from seed(), as",
    "     sql/field_scope_live_fixtures_2026-10-28.sql was. Prove it can fail: --replay --handler-ref <pre-fix sha>.",
    "  A FORMAT TRIAL of alf_mar (handler mode, 7/7, b63) is in SAIRN-handoff-cc-b63.md; it is NOT a design."
  ],
